      "title": "Randall Preserve Proximity Highlights Local Real Estate Value",
      "summary": "Recent real estate activity in Newport Beach, observed over the last 30 days, indicates that properties, particularly in the Newport Crest community, adjacent to or overlooking the Randall Preserve are being marketed with an emphasis on their proximity to the designated open space. These listings leverage the preserve's scenic views and natural surroundings as a significant amenity, reflecting a positive impact on local property appeal and desirability.",
      "source": "Local Real Estate Listings / Rentable / MLS Listings",
      "sentiment": "POSITIVE"
    },
