      "date": "August 18, 2026",
      "title": "Santa Monica Mountains Conservancy Offers $2.0M Grant for Randall Preserve",
      "summary": "The Santa Monica Mountains Conservancy has an open grant, 'Prop 4 – Randall Preserve,' offering $2.0 million for projects supporting the reduction of climate impacts on disadvantaged communities and the creation or expansion of outdoor recreation opportunities within the Randall Preserve. These funds are available for encumbrance or expenditure until June 30, 2028.",
      "source": "OpenGrants",
      "sentiment": "POSITIVE"
    },
